WEBVTT

00:00:01.730 --> 00:00:04.940
As one encounter led to a double romance...

00:00:04.940 --> 00:00:06.740
...three beating hearts...

00:00:06.740 --> 00:00:09.140
...played gentle melodies.

00:00:09.140 --> 00:00:12.450
I, Kasuga Kyosuke, 15 years old...

00:00:12.450 --> 00:00:15.030
...am living the best years of my youth!

00:00:24.650 --> 00:00:30.400
That's the accelerator screamin', as the tires are squealin'...

00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:36.950
...takin' you along, a girl I hardly knew,
in my speedin' coupe.

00:00:36.950 --> 00:00:42.680
You slammed the door,
evadin' the shadows that followed...

00:00:42.680 --> 00:00:49.420
...sayin' "Take me anywhere, Just go!"

00:00:49.420 --> 00:00:52.320
An encounter is like a highway junction...

00:00:52.320 --> 00:00:55.390
I've fallen in love with you - that I realized...

00:00:55.390 --> 00:01:01.430
...by the time the seaport was in sight...

00:01:01.430 --> 00:01:04.530
"Take me to Summer Side"

00:01:04.530 --> 00:01:13.310
Sayin' that you desire
tenderness over a caress...

00:01:13.310 --> 00:01:16.640
"Night of Summer Side"

00:01:16.640 --> 00:01:25.650
...the way you avoided me, usin' that naive look, wasn't so innocent.

00:01:25.650 --> 00:01:28.960
"Take me to Summer Side"

00:01:28.960 --> 00:01:37.730
Sayin' that you desire
a caress over loneliness...

00:01:37.730 --> 00:01:41.170
"Night of Summer Side"

00:01:41.170 --> 00:01:51.500
...the way you looked into my eyes as you turned back wasn't so innocent.

00:01:59.350 --> 00:02:05.250
Madoka's Challenge!
The Haunted Beach's Big Wave Legend.

00:02:06.990 --> 00:02:10.950
It all happened...
at a beach one summer.

00:02:28.980 --> 00:02:30.680
As if to avoid me, as I tried to kiss you...

00:02:30.680 --> 00:02:35.550
551... 552... 553...
As if to avoid me, as I tried to kiss you...

00:02:35.550 --> 00:02:35.620
As if to avoid me, as I tried to kiss you...

00:02:35.620 --> 00:02:35.680
554...

00:02:35.680 --> 00:02:38.620
...you, with your T-Shirt on, dove into the shining sea.
554...

00:02:38.620 --> 00:02:43.220
...you, with your T-Shirt on, dove into the shining sea.

00:02:43.330 --> 00:02:49.970
The white flower petals on your soaking skirt...

00:02:49.970 --> 00:02:56.850
...spread open upon the face of the blue water.

00:02:56.850 --> 00:03:01.180
Tell me why, when you winked...

00:03:01.180 --> 00:03:05.150
Oh! Yahoo! The sea!
Tell me why, when you winked...

00:03:05.150 --> 00:03:05.220
Tell me why, when you winked...

00:03:05.220 --> 00:03:05.280
...to say that you'll be mine.

00:03:05.280 --> 00:03:07.820
Yeah! Yeah!
...to say that you'll be mine.

00:03:07.820 --> 00:03:07.950
...to say that you'll be mine.

00:03:07.950 --> 00:03:11.350
"A Sunday Lodging Discount Coupon?"
...to say that you'll be mine.

00:03:11.350 --> 00:03:11.490
...to say that you'll be mine.

00:03:11.490 --> 00:03:13.150
"Yeah. A regular customer
asked if I could use them, so..."

00:03:13.150 --> 00:03:15.520
"Oh, Baby, Tell me, Tell me..." You're unpredictable...

00:03:15.520 --> 00:03:17.230
"Yeah! Lucky!

00:03:17.230 --> 00:03:17.290
"Oh, Baby, Tell me, Tell me..." You're unpredictable...

00:03:17.290 --> 00:03:17.720
"Why, there's three of them! Let's go, Darling!"

00:03:17.720 --> 00:03:21.040
"Tell me, Lover, Tell me that you need me."

00:03:21.040 --> 00:03:21.660
"Tell me, Tell me"...my Angel of the Summer...

00:03:21.660 --> 00:03:24.930
"But, I wonder, why this time of year?

00:03:24.930 --> 00:03:25.070
"Tell me, Tell me"...my Angel of the Summer...

00:03:25.070 --> 00:03:27.500
"I mean, why offer a Sunday discount?"

00:03:27.500 --> 00:03:28.040
"Oh, Baby, Tell me, Tell me..."

00:03:28.040 --> 00:03:29.770
"Now that you mention it..."

00:03:29.770 --> 00:03:30.470
I know that you're in love...

00:03:30.470 --> 00:03:32.030
"Oh, c'mon! Who cares?

00:03:32.030 --> 00:03:34.280
"Tell me, Lover, Tell me that you need me."

00:03:34.280 --> 00:03:35.370
"What matters is, Darling,
since they're offering a discount...

00:03:35.370 --> 00:03:37.150
"Tell me, Tell me"...but you're a mystery.

00:03:37.150 --> 00:03:38.450
"...maybe we'll have to share a room."

00:03:38.450 --> 00:03:38.510
"Tell me, Tell me"...but you're a mystery.

00:03:38.510 --> 00:03:39.270
"That's not so unthinkable, is it?"

00:03:39.270 --> 00:03:41.080
"Tell me, Lover, Tell me that you love me."

00:03:41.080 --> 00:03:42.550
"H...H...Hold on a sec, Hikaru!"

00:03:42.550 --> 00:03:42.620
"Tell me, Lover, Tell me that you love me."

00:03:42.620 --> 00:03:45.550
"And, if that were so... then..."

00:03:48.520 --> 00:03:50.430
"No! You were here too?!"

00:03:50.430 --> 00:03:54.300
"What the... What is it, Hikaru?"

00:03:54.300 --> 00:03:56.030
"Nothing!"

00:03:56.030 --> 00:03:58.100
"Too late, Hikaru."

00:04:03.910 --> 00:04:09.040
"When the summer ends,
it'll be over between us..."

00:04:09.040 --> 00:04:10.770
Oh! I can 't wait any longer!

00:04:10.770 --> 00:04:12.450
You looked into my eyes as if to trick me.

00:04:12.450 --> 00:04:16.350
H... Hold it, Hikaru...
What do you mean you can't wait...?

00:04:16.350 --> 00:04:16.420
You looked into my eyes as if to trick me.

00:04:16.420 --> 00:04:18.180
A... Ayukawa...
You looked into my eyes as if to trick me.

00:04:18.180 --> 00:04:18.420
The tears are falling on the reflected sky...
A... Ayukawa...

00:04:18.420 --> 00:04:24.800
The tears are falling on the reflected sky...

00:04:24.800 --> 00:04:31.910
...that shines on the bike lying down by the beach.

00:04:31.910 --> 00:04:32.670
I just can't seem to figure you out...

00:04:32.670 --> 00:04:34.570
Ta-da!
I just can't seem to figure you out...

00:04:34.570 --> 00:04:34.700
I just can't seem to figure you out...

00:04:34.700 --> 00:04:38.140
U... Under the clothes, eh...?
I just can't seem to figure you out...

00:04:38.140 --> 00:04:38.270
I just can't seem to figure you out...

00:04:38.270 --> 00:04:40.070
You got a fever or something?!

00:04:40.070 --> 00:04:48.160
Why can't I hold you down with my tenderness alone?

00:04:48.160 --> 00:04:52.590
"Oh, Baby, Tell me, Tell me..." You're unpredictable...

00:04:52.590 --> 00:04:55.360
"Tell me, Lover, Tell me that you need me."

00:04:55.360 --> 00:04:55.970
Thanks again
for the room.

00:04:55.970 --> 00:04:56.020
Later, lady!

00:04:56.020 --> 00:04:56.790
"Tell me, Tell me..." I'm in love with you...

00:04:56.790 --> 00:04:56.930
Later, lady!

00:04:56.930 --> 00:04:57.450
See you!

00:04:57.450 --> 00:04:58.890
We'll be back.
Thanks again!

00:04:58.890 --> 00:04:59.030
"Tell me, Tell me..." I'm in love with you...

00:04:59.030 --> 00:05:01.200
Good-bye!

00:05:01.200 --> 00:05:02.460
"Tell me, Tell me..." I'm in love with you...

00:05:02.560 --> 00:05:03.700
"Oh Baby, Tell me, Tell me..."

00:05:03.700 --> 00:05:04.760
This island happens to be
a well-known surfing mecca.

00:05:04.760 --> 00:05:08.440
...more and more, the closer I get to you...

00:05:08.440 --> 00:05:10.240
However...

00:05:10.240 --> 00:05:12.830
The legend of "Big Monday?!"

00:05:13.280 --> 00:05:16.320
Gee... You folks don't know?!

00:05:16.320 --> 00:05:18.280
It's about a big wave. A big wave!

00:05:18.280 --> 00:05:19.440
A big wave?!
It's about a big wave. A big wave!

00:05:19.440 --> 00:05:22.610
That's right. Every year, in August...
A big wave?!

00:05:22.610 --> 00:05:22.680
That's right. Every year, in August...

00:05:22.680 --> 00:05:24.750
...on the sunny afternoon
of the first Monday...

00:05:25.090 --> 00:05:27.020
In other words, tomorrow?

00:05:27.020 --> 00:05:28.320
That's right!

00:05:28.320 --> 00:05:32.690
From beyond the horizon comes one AMAZING...

00:05:33.630 --> 00:05:38.590
On a regular basis, a really
amazingly huge wave started coming.

00:05:39.600 --> 00:05:44.130
At first, all the surfers challenged the wave
just for the fun of it.

00:05:44.840 --> 00:05:46.580
But, you see...

00:05:46.580 --> 00:05:50.600
...not one ever managed to
ride the wave, not even once.

00:05:52.550 --> 00:05:57.310
Hmm... So we got these coupons
'cause everyone got scared and left.

00:05:57.990 --> 00:06:00.960
That's the ticket. Later!

00:06:02.590 --> 00:06:05.560
Oh! Later!

00:06:07.200 --> 00:06:10.030
Sheesh! What a womanizing bastard!

00:06:26.280 --> 00:06:29.380
"A beauty that sends a chill up my spine."

00:06:30.920 --> 00:06:35.360
That's what went through my head at that moment.

00:06:40.360 --> 00:06:45.960
Though, I wondered if she hadn't heard of the Big Wave legend.

00:06:50.440 --> 00:06:52.860
Lemme see here...

00:06:52.860 --> 00:06:58.320
Yes, looks like this one and this one could use a bit more trimming.

00:06:58.320 --> 00:07:01.620
Still... it seems to me that there are
a lot of mountain pictures in the set.

00:07:01.620 --> 00:07:04.680
Could use some pictures of the sea... Huh...?

00:07:07.020 --> 00:07:09.990
Gosh, such a bother...

00:07:18.130 --> 00:07:22.570
Hey! Can't you see that you're
interfering with my work?! Why, you...

00:07:24.740 --> 00:07:28.110
'Cause! 'Cause! It's unfair that only Oniichan gets to go to the beach!

00:07:28.110 --> 00:07:31.010
I told you not to use the Power!

00:07:31.010 --> 00:07:34.510
We wanna go to the beach too!
Take us there!

00:07:35.050 --> 00:07:38.090
It can't be helped!
I've got work to do, you know.

00:07:38.090 --> 00:07:40.490
Go to the pool! The pool!

00:07:40.760 --> 00:07:42.920
We're sick of the pool!

00:07:42.920 --> 00:07:45.830
Say, Papa... wouldn't it be nice to have some pictures of the sea...

00:07:45.830 --> 00:07:48.950
...as well as the mountain pictures... for your project, that is?

00:07:49.430 --> 00:07:52.870
Huh? Well, uh-huh...
but the deadline is, y'know...

00:07:52.870 --> 00:07:53.900
NEVER MIND that! About the Power...

00:07:53.900 --> 00:07:57.600
Work this, work that! Don't you care about
Oniichan being on the loose?!
NEVER MIND that! About the Power...

00:07:57.600 --> 00:07:57.670
NEVER MIND that! About the Power...

00:07:57.670 --> 00:08:00.440
Huh?! Wh...What do you mean by that, Kurumi?

00:08:00.440 --> 00:08:05.950
I mean... It IS the sea,
at the height of summer... Right?

00:08:05.950 --> 00:08:07.050
R... Right.

00:08:07.050 --> 00:08:09.910
H... Hey, girls...

00:08:10.350 --> 00:08:13.990
Isn't Oniichan too young to become a papa?

00:08:13.990 --> 00:08:17.580
H... Hey, Kurumi!
Don't say such foolish things!

00:08:19.160 --> 00:08:20.130
Look what you've made me do!

00:08:23.670 --> 00:08:25.600
What?! A ghost?!

00:08:25.600 --> 00:08:29.610
Yeah, supposedly she's a stunning beauty.

00:08:29.610 --> 00:08:31.910
Her name is Koto, it's said.

00:08:31.910 --> 00:08:35.970
So, this ghost named Koto is going to appear? On this beach?

00:08:37.310 --> 00:08:42.260
Yeah... You see...
since she was so beautiful...

00:08:42.260 --> 00:08:47.030
...it's said that the Lord of this province ordered her to visit him in his castle.

00:08:47.030 --> 00:08:51.830
But, you see... Koto had already promised to wed another man.

00:08:51.830 --> 00:08:55.200
The two made plans to flee the island...

00:08:55.200 --> 00:08:59.040
...before the night Koto had to appear at the castle.

00:08:59.040 --> 00:09:01.070
But, what happened was...

00:09:10.680 --> 00:09:15.320
Since then, on nights when you can see the fishermen's fires...

00:09:15.320 --> 00:09:22.350
...a beautiful, yet sad-looking ghost
is said to appear.

00:09:23.420 --> 00:09:25.670
And, on her arm...

00:09:25.670 --> 00:09:29.600
...it's said there's a scar from when she threw herself into the sea.

00:09:32.330 --> 00:09:36.130
I've never been good at listening to these kind of stories, ever since I was little.

00:09:36.400 --> 00:09:38.910
S... Such an awful story!

00:09:38.910 --> 00:09:41.640
I've gotta make sure that I go to
the bathroom before I go to bed, or else...

00:09:41.640 --> 00:09:43.110
Gosh!

00:09:43.110 --> 00:09:45.650
Oh, c'mon, Mister! Whatcha doing?!

00:09:45.650 --> 00:09:47.850
You've got one! You've got one!

00:09:47.850 --> 00:09:50.420
Oh! Wh... Why, this guy's a big one!

00:09:50.420 --> 00:09:53.730
Gee! You shouldn't have been telling crazy stories!

00:09:53.730 --> 00:09:56.700
Go for it! C'mon! C'mon, Mister!

00:09:56.700 --> 00:09:58.330
There! C'mon! C'mon!

00:09:58.330 --> 00:10:01.430
You weren't scared, Hikaru?

00:10:01.430 --> 00:10:02.630
Scared of what?

00:10:02.630 --> 00:10:06.870
What I meant was... of monsters and ghosts and whatnot...

00:10:06.870 --> 00:10:09.540
I got no problems with
stuff like that, you see.

00:10:09.540 --> 00:10:12.300
Though Madoka, on the other hand,
in all honesty, does.

00:10:14.440 --> 00:10:16.980
S... Stop that nonsense, Hikaru!

00:10:16.980 --> 00:10:18.910
Aha... Ayukawa does, eh...?
S... Stop that nonsense, Hikaru!

00:10:21.820 --> 00:10:23.920
Yeah! You did it!

00:10:23.920 --> 00:10:25.520
What the...?

00:10:25.520 --> 00:10:28.590
Gosh! It's so tiny!

00:10:38.800 --> 00:10:41.770
Wow! She's so cool!

00:10:42.500 --> 00:10:43.270
Say...

00:10:43.270 --> 00:10:45.500
Huh?
Say...

00:10:45.500 --> 00:10:45.570
Say...

00:10:45.570 --> 00:10:51.630
That woman... Don't you think that she looks kind of sad?

00:11:11.330 --> 00:11:13.230
"...city, 21st ward -- Koto"

00:11:21.780 --> 00:11:23.800
What? "Koto?!"

00:11:24.210 --> 00:11:30.010
Y... Yeah... You know, the only...

00:11:31.620 --> 00:11:33.880
...the only remaining surfer.

00:11:37.630 --> 00:11:41.960
In the lodge's guestbook...
there was the name "Koto!"

00:11:49.440 --> 00:11:52.070
If we may!

00:11:56.710 --> 00:11:58.990
Oh! Didn't know you were here.

00:11:58.990 --> 00:12:01.960
We were watching you surf this afternoon!

00:12:01.960 --> 00:12:03.460
Gee...?!

00:12:03.460 --> 00:12:05.850
Yippee!

00:12:06.450 --> 00:12:08.420
Hey, you!

00:12:16.930 --> 00:12:22.430
"On her arm, it's said there's a scar from when she threw herself into the sea."

00:12:26.870 --> 00:12:29.840
She can't be the...

00:12:46.730 --> 00:12:48.570
Where are you off to?

00:12:51.070 --> 00:12:54.630
Well... It seems that I left my T-Shirt at the beach.

00:12:57.110 --> 00:13:00.100
It's okay, Kasuga.
I should be able to find it easily.

00:13:00.550 --> 00:13:02.220
Never mind me, I tell ya.

00:13:02.220 --> 00:13:05.680
Besides, the word is that
something spooky is going to happen.

00:13:08.920 --> 00:13:10.730
That was just a story!

00:13:10.730 --> 00:13:13.500
At places like this,
people tell those sorts of stories.

00:13:13.500 --> 00:13:15.040
I wonder...

00:13:15.040 --> 00:13:17.010
I'm not sure if it means anything, but...

00:13:17.010 --> 00:13:19.300
...y'know, the woman who's
staying in the same lodge as us?

00:13:20.540 --> 00:13:21.970
It turns out that...

00:13:21.970 --> 00:13:24.940
Wh... What?! What?!
It turns out that...

00:13:26.110 --> 00:13:28.610
...her name is "Koto!"

00:13:28.610 --> 00:13:29.910
What?!
...her name is "Koto!"

00:13:33.150 --> 00:13:36.120
Why... it's only a bat.

00:13:49.900 --> 00:13:52.310
Her skin seemed so sweet, enough to make me faint...

00:13:52.310 --> 00:13:54.890
...and it felt so gentle beyond anything...

00:13:55.470 --> 00:14:01.430
Her skin... I felt as though,
if I were to touch it, it'd be a sin...

00:14:15.420 --> 00:14:16.820
I found it.

00:14:16.820 --> 00:14:17.850
Huh?
I found it.

00:14:34.880 --> 00:14:36.840
Ayukawa!

00:14:46.890 --> 00:14:49.560
The ghost!

00:14:49.560 --> 00:14:53.790
Oh, no! I've got to save Ayukawa!

00:14:54.760 --> 00:14:57.030
Don't you dare touch her!

00:14:57.030 --> 00:15:00.760
Ooo, spooky! Don't worry.
I haven't laid a finger on her yet.

00:15:03.540 --> 00:15:07.480
I didn't mean to startle you, but... I hurt my foot, as you can see.

00:15:07.480 --> 00:15:10.080
Isn't it awful? A broken bottle.

00:15:10.080 --> 00:15:12.700
The beach... it's getting polluted.

00:15:20.490 --> 00:15:22.930
So, that's why you thought I was a ghost?

00:15:22.930 --> 00:15:24.690
I'm very sorry.

00:15:24.690 --> 00:15:27.350
Oh, no. It's all right.
I'm very sorry.

00:15:27.630 --> 00:15:31.830
A ghost, huh? Even if he were a ghost, I'd like to see him once again.

00:15:33.130 --> 00:15:36.740
You see, my boyfriend died
at this beach three years ago.

00:15:36.740 --> 00:15:40.800
Th... Then... did he... from the legendary Big Monday?!

00:15:42.580 --> 00:15:45.420
He was always chasing his dreams.

00:15:45.420 --> 00:15:49.440
He said that he'd conquer that wave,
no matter what.

00:15:51.250 --> 00:15:53.860
We were young...

00:15:53.860 --> 00:15:57.360
He was that kind of person,
and I loved him.

00:16:00.860 --> 00:16:06.320
Then... are you going to...
challenge the Big Monday tomorrow?

00:16:07.570 --> 00:16:10.540
That is... in place of your boyfriend?

00:16:11.970 --> 00:16:15.450
I was trying to decide what to do.

00:16:15.450 --> 00:16:21.470
If he couldn't ride that wave,
then there's no way I'd be able to.

00:16:23.180 --> 00:16:26.150
But, you see... if I don't, then I...

00:16:27.820 --> 00:16:32.190
...I feel like I won't ever be able to get over him and get married.

00:16:35.600 --> 00:16:38.570
"...get married?"

00:16:41.540 --> 00:16:44.510
But, with this foot... looks like
riding the wave will be impossible.

00:16:49.280 --> 00:16:51.250
Are you all right?

00:16:54.480 --> 00:16:56.210
Thank you.

00:16:57.080 --> 00:16:58.420
Is she your girlfriend?

00:16:58.420 --> 00:17:00.390
What?
Is she your girlfriend?

00:17:02.490 --> 00:17:06.200
She's pretty. You guys have a lot to look forward to.

00:17:06.200 --> 00:17:10.660
Be sure to protect her with
all your strength! Good night.

00:17:21.580 --> 00:17:24.210
Ayukawa...

00:17:24.210 --> 00:17:27.390
At times like these... I've got to protect her with all my might...

00:17:27.390 --> 00:17:31.010
...without anybody telling me to.

00:17:50.570 --> 00:17:54.250
At any rate... the weight that my body was bearing...

00:17:54.250 --> 00:17:58.270
...felt so comfortable,
beyond what words can describe.

00:18:05.890 --> 00:18:08.190
Good morning.

00:18:08.190 --> 00:18:10.800
K... Kasuga!

00:18:10.800 --> 00:18:13.030
Er... that woman from before...

00:18:13.030 --> 00:18:15.170
Oh... her...

00:18:15.170 --> 00:18:17.700
So, she was... a ghost?

00:18:17.700 --> 00:18:19.770
Yeah.

00:18:25.670 --> 00:18:28.820
Oh, c'mon! You're lying, aren't you!

00:18:28.820 --> 00:18:31.920
Why you...! Gee...

00:18:31.920 --> 00:18:34.950
Put me down!
I can walk by myself, thank you!

00:18:35.480 --> 00:18:39.530
What's this?! Would you put me down!

00:18:39.530 --> 00:18:42.160
C'mon, Kasuga!

00:18:42.160 --> 00:18:44.030
Will you put me down please!

00:18:44.030 --> 00:18:46.330
Hey, would you please!

00:18:46.330 --> 00:18:49.360
C'mon! Put me down!

00:18:50.730 --> 00:18:54.260
And so... all the ghost hoopla calmed down, but...

00:18:59.810 --> 00:19:02.170
What?! Ayukawa is...?!

00:19:02.480 --> 00:19:06.850
She says she's going to challenge
the Big Monday in that woman's place!

00:19:06.850 --> 00:19:10.210
No way! It's crazy,
not even Madoka could...

00:19:15.520 --> 00:19:17.490
Madoka!

00:19:27.970 --> 00:19:32.250
This wasn't the same Ayukawa that was scared of a ghost...

00:19:32.250 --> 00:19:34.430
She was like a completely different person.

00:19:38.980 --> 00:19:40.980
"Between... women...?"

00:19:40.980 --> 00:19:45.610
"Yeah... I sort of understand it...
What she feels, that is."

00:19:46.320 --> 00:19:48.910
"Well, I don't doubt that, but..."

00:19:53.930 --> 00:19:55.770
"It'll be fine."

00:19:55.770 --> 00:19:59.810
"I think that her boyfriend will...
protect me...

00:19:59.810 --> 00:20:02.100
"...in place of her."

00:20:02.100 --> 00:20:04.170
"Madoka..."

00:20:07.980 --> 00:20:09.940
Here it comes!

00:20:27.360 --> 00:20:29.450
The legendary Big Monday...

00:20:34.870 --> 00:20:37.700
Is this... what you want?

00:20:42.180 --> 00:20:47.140
And... are you over him now?
The boyfriend who passed away?

00:21:30.860 --> 00:21:32.160
No! The board's nose!

00:21:32.160 --> 00:21:32.950
Ayukawa!
No! The board's nose!

00:21:32.950 --> 00:21:35.550
Eyaah! Madoka!
Ayukawa!

00:21:37.630 --> 00:21:38.930
O... Oh, no!

00:22:09.630 --> 00:22:11.500
Madoka!

00:22:11.500 --> 00:22:13.730
Hikaru, wait! It's dangerous!

00:22:13.730 --> 00:22:17.170
But... But... Madoka is...

00:22:28.680 --> 00:22:31.080
Madoka!

00:22:48.170 --> 00:22:50.370
What? You mean, all of a sudden?

00:22:50.370 --> 00:22:51.950
Yeah.

00:22:51.950 --> 00:22:55.320
Just when I thought I was finished... I started to float all of a sudden...

00:22:55.320 --> 00:22:59.080
...and before I knew it,
I was back on the board again.

00:22:59.080 --> 00:23:02.020
Gosh...

00:23:02.020 --> 00:23:04.520
Your boyfriend... saved me, I bet.

00:23:13.860 --> 00:23:20.430
At any rate, I was able to protect someone very important to me.

00:23:24.710 --> 00:23:28.420
Anyways... at that moment, it felt as if...

00:23:28.420 --> 00:23:32.430
...I was far more powerful
than even the sun.

00:23:55.040 --> 00:24:02.650
I dream of casting a spell that captures your heart...

00:24:02.650 --> 00:24:10.220
...and makes you crazy about me.

00:24:10.220 --> 00:24:25.570
Love is deja vu; an unfamiliar memory. I feel our lips pressing together.

00:24:25.570 --> 00:24:38.190
Love me... tenderly...
Golden Summer Mirage...

00:24:38.190 --> 00:24:48.400
Someday... Someday... Please let my body feel your lips...

00:24:48.400 --> 00:24:55.400
...on that morning I'll be called your lover.

00:24:55.400 --> 00:25:06.810
Someday, someday...
I'll be waiting for that moment.

00:25:12.180 --> 00:25:14.660
No matter which way we look, we're surrounded by the sea.

00:25:14.660 --> 00:25:18.390
Ayukawa and I got shipwrecked,
and now we're on a deserted island.

00:25:18.390 --> 00:25:20.160
We'd like to be rescued ASAP...

00:25:20.160 --> 00:25:24.300
...though... being able to spend the starry nights together...

00:25:24.300 --> 00:25:27.330
...is well... er... indescribable...

00:25:27.330 --> 00:25:31.330
Next time: "An Experience for Two! An Island of Forbidden Love."
